00:16:12,180 --> 00:16:15,700
non-aparticle delivery of agents.

00:16:15,700 --> 00:16:20,700
So what that means is that we use the patient's own platelets,

00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:26,180
we mix those platelets through a ultrasonic process

00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:31,460
with specific agents that we want to get into the tumor site

00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:34,340
and then we do a micro filtration of that

00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:38,340
to make those particles very small, very non-anized

00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:41,900
so that they can easily penetrate any kind of tissue.

00:16:41,900 --> 00:16:46,900
And the beauty with platelets is that they tumors use platelets

00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:53,420
for their own benefit and they are drawn to locations

00:16:53,420 --> 00:16:54,980
of inflammation.

00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:59,980
Obviously the cancer tumor micro environment

00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:02,220
is very inflammatory.

00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:06,740
