00:17:06,740 --> 00:17:10,460
than of whatever agent that you want to get in there,

00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:13,900
whether you're using mistletoe or artisanate

00:17:13,900 --> 00:17:16,220
or whether you want to bring in some peptides

00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:21,220
like times an alpha-1 to modulate that micro environment

00:17:21,860 --> 00:17:26,420
or whether you want to kind of do a photosensitizer

00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:30,140
to increase the concentration like methylene blue

00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:35,140
or ICG or riboflavin which are powerful photosensitizer.

00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:40,380
So that is what we've been doing for quite some time.

